{title: Sanam Teri Kasam}
{artist: Ankit Tiwari}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
Betaha [Cm]sha dil mein,        Tujhko hi [G#]chaha hai
Har dua [Cm]mein maine,        Tujhko hi [G#]maanga hai
Tera jaa [A#]na jaise ko [G#]i bad dua [Cm],        Tera jaa [A#]na jaise ko [G#]i bad dua [G]
Door jaa [Cm]oge jo tum,        Marr jaa [G#]yenge hum
Sanam [Cm]teri kasam [A#]hoo,        Sanam [Cm]teri kasam [A#]hoo
Sanam [G#]teri kasam,        Tumhe [Cm]dekhte hi aankhe
Ho jaati [A#]namm,        Sanam [Cm]teri kasam [A#]hoo
Sanam [Cm]teri kasam [A#]hoo,        Sanam [G#]teri kasam
[Cm]Hua ye kya [G#]hashar mera,        [Cm]Judaa hua [A#]sabar mera
Main [A#]tere bin ek lamha kyun,        Kabhi [G#]naa jiya [G]
